# Frontend

## Layout

```text
frontend/src/
  features/<feature>/{pages,hooks,components}/
  components/ui/          # shadcn / Base UI primitives
  common/                 # api client, ProtectedRoutes, shared pages/hooks
  App.tsx                 # routes
  AppLayout.tsx           # authenticated shell
  main.tsx                # ClerkProvider + QueryClientProvider
```

Features today: `auth`, `overview`, `settings`. Colocate new UI with the feature that owns it.

## Data fetching

- Use the shared OpenAPI client from `@/common/api` (`authClient` via `openapi-fetch`).
- Types come from `@recallio/api-types` (`paths`, `components['schemas']`).
- Wrap calls in TanStack Query hooks under `features/*/hooks/`:

```typescript
export function useShopify() {
  return useQuery({
    queryKey: ['shopify', 'shop'],
    queryFn: async () => {
      const { data, error } = await authClient.GET('/api/integrations/shopify/shop');
      if (error) throw error;
      return data;
    },
    retry: false,
  });
}
```

- `authClient` attaches Clerk Bearer tokens and surfaces 429 via rate-limit middleware — do not reinvent auth headers.
- Base URL: `import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL` only (see `frontend/.env.local`).

## Auth & routing

- Clerk (`@clerk/react`) for session UI; protect app routes with `ProtectedRoute`.
- Public: `/login`, `/signup`. Authenticated shell under `/` via `AppLayout`.
- Do not call Shopify/Anthropic SDKs from the browser; use backend `/api/...` routes.

## UI

- Prefer existing `components/ui/*` (shadcn + Base UI + Tailwind).
- Alias `@/` → `frontend/src`.
- Toasts: Sonner. Forms: React Hook Form where already used.
- Keep feature pages focused; extract hooks for API/state, components for reusable UI.
